["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Airbnb CEO Brian Chesky: “I Was a Great Founder and a Terrible CEO” founder mode skip level\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-02-howibuilt-airbnb能活下来-是因为商业模式好到掩盖了管理混乱/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c49ad29f2140d349-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"H\"><span class=\"dur\">1:15:37</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">How I Built This</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1102</span></div>\n<h2>Airbnb能活下来，是因为商业模式好到掩盖了管理混乱</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他说Airbnb商业模式好到能掩盖管理混乱，直到疫情把公司逼到生死关头，他才被迫从放权转向事必躬亲的创始人模式。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">领导力</span><span class=\"tag\">创始人模式</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"20VC: Who Wins the Inference Market | Has Open-Source LLM Inference Peaked? | What Happens to the Cost of Compute | The Real Limits of Post-Training and RL with Erik Bernhardsson, Modal CEO NeoCloud PLG (Product-Led Growth) sandbox\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-02-twentyvc-ai推理不再有90-毛利-每多一层供应商就分走利润/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/039f47c822a2df13-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:02:10</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">20VC</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1102</span></div>\n<h2>AI推理不再有90%毛利，每多一层供应商就分走利润</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">一美元从客户流到英伟达手里，要经过应用、模型、基础设施、云等好几层，每层都切走20%到30%的毛利，这就是AI基础设施公司回不到软件黄金时代毛利率的原因。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI推理</span><span class=\"tag\">GPU算力</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"The Rise of Peter The Great Streltsi Grand Embassy knout fiscal-military state\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-02-historyhit-彼得大帝西游归来-只搬技术-绝口不提议会与自由/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9e331afa96f76fb1-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">47:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">History Hit</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1102</span></div>\n<h2>彼得大帝西游归来：只搬技术，绝口不提议会与自由</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">他访问了光荣革命后的英国和共和制的荷兰，带回的只有造船术、刮胡刀新规和炮台图纸，议会与政治自由被原样留在了西欧。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">俄国历史</span><span class=\"tag\">彼得大帝</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"Episode Summary 13: What Is Neuroaffirming ADHD Support? A Counselor Explains neuroaffirming interest-based nervous system MCAS Ehlers-Danlos syndrome executive function\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-02-parentmojo-adhd不是自控力缺陷-而是神经系统处理世界的方式不同/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/70c340acb32275d2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"Y\"><span class=\"dur\">29:02</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Your Parenting Mojo</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1102</span></div>\n<h2>ADHD不是自控力缺陷，而是神经系统处理世界的方式不同</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">主流框架把ADHD当作执行功能缺陷、靠自控力纠正；这位心理咨询师认为根源是注意力调节和感官系统天生不同，这套神经系统曾是人类赖以生存的优势。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">ADHD</span><span class=\"tag\">神经多样性</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"719. Revolution in the Soviet Empire: The Hungarian Uprising (Part 1) Salami tactics AVH Secret Speech Petofi Circle 16 Points\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-02-restishistory-点燃匈牙利1956年革命的-是一群诗人作家办的辩论俱乐部/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7094b2e761027f4c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:25:31</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Rest Is History</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1102</span></div>\n<h2>点燃匈牙利1956年革命的，是一群诗人作家办的辩论俱乐部</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">十一年高压统治后，真正点燃起义的不是地下党或工人领袖，而是一群诗人作家办的公开辩论会，这说明拉科西政权早已只剩暴力，没有任何人心可守。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">冷战史</span><span class=\"tag\">苏联</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"409. JFK: The Cuban Missile Crisis (Part 3) ExComm / XCOM Trollope ploy Operation Mongoose Black Saturday soft power\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-02-empirehist-古巴导弹危机差点开打核战-全靠一名苏联军官投了反对票/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6dcfd4bf69c91d0f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">1:02:36</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Empire 世界史</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1102</span></div>\n<h2>古巴导弹危机差点开打核战，全靠一名苏联军官投了反对票</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">苏联核潜艇B-59上，三名军官里两人同意发射核鱼雷，唯独阿尔希波夫一人反对——这一票按苏联规定具有否决权，挡住了核战的引爆点。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">冷战</span><span class=\"tag\">古巴导弹危机</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Nathanael Greene 2: Logistics of War | | U.S. Revolutionary War History Quartermaster General Fighting Quaker\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-02-extracredits-独立战争最惨的两年-靠一位不想干后勤的人撑住/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><div class=\"fallback\">E</div><span class=\"dur\">16:31</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">ExtraCredits</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1102</span></div>\n<h2>独立战争最惨的两年，靠一位不想干后勤的人撑住</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">格林打赢过特伦顿和普林斯顿，也在布兰迪万和日耳曼敦吃了败仗，但真正让大陆军撑过去的，是他硬着头皮接下的后勤总管职位。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">美国独立战争</span><span class=\"tag\">后勤管理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Rise of GLM and China’s Zhipu AI GLM (General Language Model) MoE (Mixture-of-Experts) Model-as-a-Service KEG (Knowledge Engineering Group) P2P (Paper to Product)\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-01-asianometry-智谱研发支出是营收两倍-靠免费开源模型换增长能撑多久/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/701791e3cef20e9a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">22:44</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Asianometry</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1101</span></div>\n<h2>智谱研发支出是营收两倍，靠免费开源模型换增长能撑多久</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">智谱把最新模型全部开源免费发布，但研发支出已是营收的两倍——这桩靠烧钱换声量的生意能撑多久，是全篇最后抛出的真问题。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">智谱AI</span><span class=\"tag\">开源大模型</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"183期重发 | 投资的周期思维、共识游戏与亏钱教训 Bullwhip Effect Crossing the Chasm\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-01-touzishizhan-全球只有2-4-的公司能让你长期赚钱-其余都该阶段性持有/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/84ddf31325c222e2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"投\"><span class=\"dur\">1:59:41</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">投资实战派</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1101</span></div>\n<h2>全球只有2.4%的公司能让你长期赚钱，其余都该阶段性持有</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">统计显示2.4%之外的公司大多让收益原地打转甚至归零，这期给出了判断一家公司是否属于那2.4%的具体方法：预期回报公式、估值锚点和企业生命周期买点。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">价值投资</span><span class=\"tag\">资本周期</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"How a 19-year-old intern built the growth engine behind this $2B AI company | Hector Serrano UGC CPM GMV ICP smart retainer ad fatigue\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-01-lennys-创作者靠广告分成赚钱-而非播放量-撑起20亿美元ai公司/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3c676784fa788b53-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:27:47</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Lenny&#x27;s Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1101</span></div>\n<h2>创作者靠广告分成赚钱，而非播放量，撑起20亿美元AI公司</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">创作者按广告花费抽成、不设上限，靠「smart retainer」兜底，这套付费UGC体系撑起了Whisperflow过去一年30倍的营收增长。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">付费UGC</span><span class=\"tag\">创作者经济</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"How Bending Spoons Built a $20 Billion Compounder | Luca Ferrari SaaSpocalypse\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-01-a16z-ai把代码成本打到近零-但多数软件护城河并未坍塌/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">44:20</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1101</span></div>\n<h2>AI把代码成本打到近零，但多数软件护城河并未坍塌</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">多数规模化软件产品的复制成本在AI出现前就已经很低，它们真正的护城河是习惯、网络效应和专有数据，而非代码本身的稀缺性。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">护城河</span><span class=\"tag\">SaaS</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"TWiV 1371: How to Bat Away Marburg Virus clade / genotype TMRCA reassortment α-2,6 sialic acid receptor interferon epsilon\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-01-twiv-水貂感染h5n1-传播路径空白三个月-美国农业部选择不查/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://www.microbe.tv/wp-content/uploads/2018/09/TWiV_v3_white.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:49:03</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Virology</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1101</span></div>\n<h2>水貂感染H5N1,传播路径空白三个月，美国农业部选择不查</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">得州奶牛场与犹他水貂场的H5N1已经对上信号，但中间三个月的传播链没人查——美国农业部没要求扑杀，也不监测工人和周边农场。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">H5N1禽流感</span><span class=\"tag\">水貂</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"The Mycenaeans: Was Agamemnon Real? Linear B Wanax Tholos tomb Cyclopean walls Corbelling Sea Peoples\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-11-01-ancients-荷马史诗英雄的名字-其实是迈锡尼泥板上的普通人名/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/27f59ba28fc2607a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:07:37</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Ancients</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1101</span></div>\n<h2>荷马史诗英雄的名字，其实是迈锡尼泥板上的普通人名</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">迈锡尼王宫的记账泥板上，埃特奥克勒斯、阿喀琉斯只是欠王宫东西的普通百姓名字——荷马史诗里的英雄名，原来是当时随处可见的称呼。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">迈锡尼</span><span class=\"tag\">青铜时代</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"AI:AM: Carbon in the Arena, Mistral&#x27;s Le Chonk, the Agent-Run Economy, Ferroelectric RAM + New Hacks EUV Mixture of Experts (MoE) ferroelectric memory APT\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-31-cogrev-生产数据显示openai比anthropic更少撒谎/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bce300797e23ca51-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:27:57</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Cognitive Revolution</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1031</span></div>\n<h2>生产数据显示OpenAI比Anthropic更少撒谎</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Arena用真实生产对话打分：OpenAI在未授权操作、虚假归因、欺骗性完成三项信号上全面反超Anthropic，个位数误导率换算到真实用量已经相当可观。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI对齐</span><span class=\"tag\">开源模型</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Using Agents for Long-Horizon Financial Work — Aman Singh, Arca harness managed agents fiduciary RMD prompt injection\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-31-latentspace-ai原生财富管理公司-不是人在催ai-是ai在催人/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f748ae3e2793f6d3-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">26:05</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Latent Space</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1031</span></div>\n<h2>AI原生财富管理公司：不是人在催AI，是AI在催人</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">这家财富管理公司不是套了AI工具的服务商，而是AI原生的公司本身：智能体主动联系顾问与客户、持续追踪他们的税务和退休计划，人类只负责审批和执行交易。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">智能体</span><span class=\"tag\">财富管理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"The Skeptics Guide #1112 - Oct 31 2026 Scopus regression discontinuity design Penning trap CPT symmetry APOE4\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-31-skeptics-超3500家亮红灯的问题期刊-照样被主流数据库收录/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cc4dc31b3b84e70d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:54:32</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Skeptics Guide</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1031</span></div>\n<h2>超3500家亮红灯的问题期刊，照样被主流数据库收录</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">研究发现3753家期刊出现造假预警信号，其中3557家仍被Scopus正常收录，说明「发表论文」本身已不再等于可信。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">科研诚信</span><span class=\"tag\">期刊造假</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"SYMHC Classics: Helen Duncan ectoplasm teleplasm materialization medium Vagrancy Act Witchcraft Act 1735 Fraudulent Mediums Act\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-31-stuffmissed-她在降神会说中两艘军舰沉没-英国用巫术法让她闭嘴/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">38:43</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1031</span></div>\n<h2>她在降神会说中两艘军舰沉没，英国用巫术法让她闭嘴</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">检察官当庭声明这与巫术无关，纯属诈骗，但真正促使动用1735年巫术法的，是她曾说中两艘英国军舰的沉没，军方担心她在诺曼底登陆前走漏消息。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">灵媒诈骗</span><span class=\"tag\">二战谍报</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Dan Williams on Why AI (Probably) Won’t Kill Us AI as Normal Technology stochastic parrots NIMBY post-training conflict entrepreneurs\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-31-goodfight-大语言模型其实是社交媒体的反面-而非升级版/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c75b9a8ba0dff85c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">The Good Fight</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1031</span></div>\n<h2>大语言模型其实是社交媒体的反面，而非升级版</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">社交媒体靠算法放大耸动内容拉低公共讨论，目前的ChatGPT、Claude、Gemini甚至Grok却默认追求准确克制——但这优势未必持久。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">教育</span><span class=\"tag\">虚假信息</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Can AI Fix Professional Networking? | Inside Cosign MCP coincidence of intent golden handcuffs agent-to-agent protocol\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-31-a16z-领英永远不会做的事-开放一张可搜索的人脉信任图谱/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">25:21</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1031</span></div>\n<h2>领英永远不会做的事：开放一张可搜索的人脉信任图谱</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">a16z 押注的 Cosign 认为，招聘的下一步不是海投简历，而是你信任的人——未来甚至是你的 AI agent——替你做第一轮筛选。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI agent</span><span class=\"tag\">招聘</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"TWiV 1370: Clinical Update with Dr. Daniel Griffin clade 2.3.4.4B seroconversion ELISpot assay TH1/TH2 response post-exposure prophylaxis\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-31-twiv-佛罗里达若废除入学强制接种-模型预测五年内数百儿童将死于麻疹/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://www.microbe.tv/wp-content/uploads/2018/09/TWiV_v3_white.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:01:05</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Virology</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1031</span></div>\n<h2>佛罗里达若废除入学强制接种，模型预测五年内数百儿童将死于麻疹</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">用数学模型测算，取消学校强制接种疫苗的要求将在佛罗里达引发近半个世纪来美国最大规模麻疹疫情，五年内数百名儿童和婴儿可能因此死亡。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">公共卫生</span><span class=\"tag\">禽流感</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"⚡ Building ChatGPT for Finance — Joseph Kim, OpenAI&#x27;s Head of Financial Services MCP RLHF reward model readability GDP eval\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-31-latentspace-现成数据接口错误率超40-逼得openai自建数据管道/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c081d94ef2cea125-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">27:34</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Latent Space</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1031</span></div>\n<h2>现成数据接口错误率超40%，逼得OpenAI自建数据管道</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">测试发现部分知名MCP数据连接器错误率超40%，促使OpenAI放弃直接调用插件，转而自建数据管道作为金融产品的核心竞争力。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">金融AI</span><span class=\"tag\">企业产品</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Anthropic S-1 Shocker, Greatest Business Ever? Google&#x27;s $500B Wipeout, Midterm Predictions S-1 convertible notes recursive self-improvement (RSI) Vickrey auction ARR\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-30-allin-anthropic800亿美元亏损是假账-实际烧钱不到100亿/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f8f622bd4f103f10-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">1:25:47</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">All-In</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1030</span></div>\n<h2>Anthropic800亿美元亏损是假账，实际烧钱不到100亿</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">那800亿亏损来自给亚马逊等基础设施伙伴发的可转换票据——估值越涨账面亏损越大，但钱从没真花出去，实际总烧钱只有90亿到100亿美元。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Anthropic IPO</span><span class=\"tag\">AI估值</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"The Future of Financial Advice: Masters in Business with Rich Steinmeier RIA wire house non-compete transition assistance ERISA 40-30-30 portfolio\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-30-mastersinbiz-没有竞业协议-顾问随时能走-这家万亿资管公司流失率却最低/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bf628cdceaa5d753-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">1:08:11</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Masters in Business</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1030</span></div>\n<h2>没有竞业协议、顾问随时能走，这家万亿资管公司流失率却最低</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">LPL的顾问是独立老板，没有竞业协议，想走就走，LPL甚至帮他们带走客户资料，逼着自己每天重新赢得信任，流失率因此远低于行业的5%。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">财富管理</span><span class=\"tag\">独立顾问模式</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"What Happens When Everyone Can Build Software RSI vibe coding Lindy effect PLG\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-30-ycsp-数据库公司七成新增用量来自ai代理-不是人类工程师/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/30dacdc60410d57c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"Y\"><span class=\"dur\">48:45</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Y Combinator</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1030</span></div>\n<h2>数据库公司七成新增用量来自AI代理，不是人类工程师</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">各行各业的人不再需要说服工程师才能动手：AI让懂业务的人直接建出复杂系统，这个新建造者群体的增长目前看不到天花板。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI agent</span><span class=\"tag\">开发者工具</span>\n</div></div></a>"]